  = note: int32[] is an array, whose elements can be assigned
  = note: deeply immutable types are bool, numbers, string, tuples and enums of such types, #Immutable classes whose fields are too, and FrozenList of them
  = help: make the class #Immutable, or replace a list with a FrozenList

For more information about this error, try `neura explain E0580`.
